# 🍷 Australian Wine Company — Business Insights Dashboard

![Tableau](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tableau-Data%20Visualization-blue)
![Business Intelligence](https://img.shields.io/badge/Business-Intelligence-orange)
![Analytics](https://img.shields.io/badge/Analytics-Business%20Analytics-green)

## 📌 Project Overview

The **Australian Wine Company Insights Dashboard** is an interactive business intelligence project developed in **Tableau** to analyze sales performance, product trends, customer behavior and key business KPIs.

The project transforms business data into an interactive dashboard that enables users to explore sales patterns, identify high-performing products and customers, and understand overall business performance.

---

## 🎯 Business Problem

The objective of this project is to provide a consolidated view of business performance and answer key analytical questions such as:

- How is overall sales performance trending?
- Which products contribute most to sales?
- Which customers generate the highest business value?
- How does sales performance vary across different categories?
- What are the key trends and patterns in the business?
- Which areas require further investigation or management attention?

The dashboard is designed to support **data-driven business performance monitoring and decision-making**.

---

## 📊 Dashboard

The Tableau dashboard provides an interactive view of:

- Sales performance
- Revenue trends
- Product performance
- Customer analysis
- KPI tracking
- Business trends
- Comparative performance analysis

### 🔗 Interactive Tableau Dashboard

[**View Australian Wine Company Insights Dashboard on Tableau Public**](https://public.tableau.com/views/AustralianWineCompanyInsightsDashboard_17593967646220/AustralianWineCompanyInsightsDashboard)

---

## 🔍 Analysis Covered

### 1. Sales Performance Analysis

- Overall sales performance
- Revenue trends
- Sales contribution analysis
- Period-wise performance
- Identification of key sales patterns

### 2. Product Analysis

- Product-level performance
- High-performing products
- Product contribution to overall sales
- Comparison of product performance

### 3. Customer Analysis

- Customer-level sales performance
- Identification of high-value customers
- Customer contribution analysis
- Comparison of customer segments

### 4. KPI Analysis

The dashboard provides a consolidated view of important business performance indicators to support quick performance monitoring.

### 5. Trend Analysis

Interactive visualizations help identify:

- Growth and decline patterns
- Sales trends
- Product-level changes
- Customer-level patterns
- Areas requiring further analysis

---

## 📈 Dashboard Features

- Interactive filters
- KPI cards
- Trend analysis
- Product comparisons
- Customer analysis
- Dynamic charts
- Drill-down exploration
- Business-focused visual storytelling

---

## 🧠 Business Insights

The analysis demonstrates how business intelligence can be used to:

- Identify important revenue and sales drivers
- Understand product performance
- Identify high-value customers
- Monitor business KPIs
- Detect trends and performance changes
- Support data-driven decision-making

The dashboard is intended to convert raw business data into an **easy-to-understand management view of business performance**.

